              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "• TypeScript strict mode, test coverage >80%\n• CI/CD: GitHub Actions → ArgoCD GitOps\n• Observability: OpenTelemetry, Grafana dashboards\n• Security: Secrets management, vulnerability scanning\n• Documentation: OpenAPI spec, Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)" } }]
