              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "Single Region Pilot" } }],
              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "• Deploy to staging K8s (EKS/GKE)\n• Shadow mode: inference parallel to manual review\n• A/B testing framework for model versions\n• Load testing: 10K claims/day baseline\n• Compliance audit: UU PDP, SATUSEHAT integration test\n• Go/No-Go: Precision >90%, Latency p99 <500ms, Zero critical vulns" } }]
            ]
          }
        },
