              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "Multi-Region Production" } }],
              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "• Multi-region active-active (Jakarta + Singapore DR)\n• Feature Store (Feast) for training-serving consistency\n• Automated retraining pipeline (monthly + drift detection)\n• Graph DB cluster (FalkorDB HA) for fraud ring queries\n• Advanced explainability: Counterfactual explanations\n• Integration: BPJS V-Claim API, SATUSEHAT Terminology Server\n• Target: 100K claims/day, 99.9% availability" } }]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "object": "block",
