              [{ "type": "text", "text": { "content": "• LLM integration: Clinical narrative summarization (fine-tuned IndoBERT)\n• Active learning loop: Human feedback → model improvement\n• Federated learning: Cross-provider training without data sharing\n• Real-time streaming: Kafka/Flink for sub-second detection\n• Expansion: Pharmacy fraud, Provider network anomaly\n• Open platform: Plugin architecture for 3rd party models" } }]
